    "value": "Requirements extracted from Zimmermann Functional Requirements excel, downloaded July 3rd, 2026 after all requirements were confirmed.— source of truth. Req ID prefix: **CAI**.\n\n⚠️ **Rows with strikethrough are out of scope** — struck through in the Excel source file.\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Req ID | Functional Area | Sub-Functional Area | Requirement | Owner | Storefront | Config/Custom | Status | Comments | User Stories |\n| CAI-001 | Cart & Inventory | Mini-Cart | The system will display a mini-cart overlay when a customer clicks the Add to Bag CTA or the cart icon in the header, showing product image, name, price, size, and quantity for each line item. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Mini-Cart confirmed Out of Scope  @Vicky Routley | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%3DCAI-001> |\n| CAI-002 | Cart & Inventory | Mini-Cart | The system will display a subtotal (inclusive or exclusive of tax, configured per storefront) and a Checkout CTA button in the mini-cart, navigating the customer to the checkout entry page. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Mini-Cart confirmed Out of Scope  @Vicky Routley | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-002> |\n| CAI-003 | Cart & Inventory | Mini-Cart | The system will include a View Bag link in the mini-cart to navigate the customer to the full cart page. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Mini-Cart confirmed Out of Scope  @Vicky Routley | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-003> |\n| CAI-004 | Cart & Inventory | Mini-Cart | The system will display a Move to Wishlist and Remove action per line item in the mini-cart. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Mini-Cart confirmed Out of Scope  @Vicky Routley | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-004> |\n| CAI-005 | Cart & Inventory | Mini-Cart | The system will display a Recommended for You product carousel beneath the bag contents in the mini-cart, powered by SFCC Einstein (or Athos Commerce pending search platform decision). | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Mini-Cart confirmed Out of Scope  @Vicky Routley | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-005> |\n| CAI-006 | Cart & Inventory | Cart Page | The system will display the product image, name, colour, price, size, quantity, and item total for each line item on the cart page. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-006> |\n| CAI-006 | Cart & Inventory | Mini-Cart | The system will display the product image, name, colour, price, size, quantity, and item total for each line item in the mini bag. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-006> |\n| CAI-007 | Cart & Inventory | Cart Page | The system will allow customers to update item quantity directly from the cart page using increment and decrement controls. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-007> |\n| CAI-008 | Cart & Inventory | Cart Page | The system will allow customers to remove an item or move it to their wishlist from the cart page. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-008> |\n| CAI-009 | Cart & Inventory | Cart Page | The system will display an order summary on the cart page including: total number of items, subtotal (inclusive or exclusive of tax per storefront), shipping cost (TBC at checkout), tax amount where applicable, and grand total in local currency. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-009> |\n| CAI-010 | Cart & Inventory | Cart Page | The system will display a prominent Checkout CTA button on the cart page. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-010> |\n| CAI-011 | Cart & Inventory | Cart Page | The system will display a promotion code entry field on the cart page. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-011> |\n| CAI-012 | Cart & Inventory | Cart Page | The system will display an empty cart message when all items have been removed from the bag. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-012> |\n| CAI-013 | Cart & Inventory | Cart Page | The system will display sale pricing (was/now) consistently across mini-cart and full cart page for any line item on promotion. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-013> |\n| CAI-014 | Cart & Inventory | Cart Behaviour | The system will persist the cart for guest users for 30 days. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-014> |\n| CAI-015 | Cart & Inventory | Cart Behaviour | The system will persist the cart indefinitely for logged-in customers. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-015> |\n| CAI-016 | Cart & Inventory | Cart Behaviour | When the price of a line item changes while it is in a customer's cart (e.g. due to a promotion or sale), the system will automatically reflect the updated price in the cart and mini-cart. No customer notification is required at this stage. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-016> |\n| CAI-017 | Cart & Inventory | Cart Behaviour | The system will enforce a maximum of 3 units per SKU (same size and colour) per customer per order; an error message will be displayed if the customer attempts to exceed this limit. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-017> |\n| CAI-018 | Cart & Inventory | Cart Behaviour | Wishlist functionality will require authentication. When a guest user attempts to move an item to the wishlist, the system will redirect them to the login page. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-018> |\n| CAI-019 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | The system will receive a full inventory feed from Newstore OMS via MuleSoft daily | Zimmerman | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | Note: this requirement is captured as part of SFCC-190f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira  This requirement does not need a user story.  It will also touch areas such as Mulesoft development, Mulesoft orchestration, SFCC configuration, SFCC job configuration |\n| CAI-020 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | The system will receive a delta inventory feed from Newstore OMS via MuleSoft, the frequency should be configurable | Zimmerman | ALL | Config | Confirmed | Note: this requirement is captured as part of SFCC-190f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira  This requirement does not need a user story.  It will also touch areas such as Mulesoft development, Mulesoft orchestration, SFCC configuration, SFCC job configuration |  |\n| CAI-022 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | All inventory calls (real-time and delta) are routed through MuleSoft and are not made directly from SFCC to NewStore OMS. | Zimmerman | ALL | Config | Confirmed | Note: this requirement is captured as part of SFCC-190f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira  This requirement does not need a user story.  It will also touch areas such as Mulesoft development, Mulesoft orchestration, SFCC configuration, SFCC job configuration |  |\n| CAI-023 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | The system will receive combined inventory across all warehouses and eligible boutiques for each region (from Mulesoft) to determine the available-to-promise stock quantity. This aggregated figure will drive all product availability states (Add to Bag, Back Soon, Out of Stock) displayed to the customer as they browse the storefront. | Zimmerman | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-023> |\n| CAI-024 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | The system will apply a configurable buffer stock threshold to inventory levels received from the product feed. Products will be displayed as available on PDP only when stock exceeds the defined buffer threshold. Buffer is applied at SFCC level, not in the inventory feed itself. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-024> |\n| CAI-025 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | The system will allow a business user to configure a buffer stock threshold per SKU per storefront in SFCC Business Manager. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-025> |\n| CAI-026 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | The system will display ADD TO BAG on the PDP when stock for a variant exceeds the configured buffer threshold. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-026> |\n| CAI-027 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | The system will display an OUT OF STOCK state on the PDP for items that are above zero stock but below the configured buffer threshold; the Add to Bag button will be disabled and a back-in-stock notification option will be presented. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-027> |\n| CAI-028 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | The system will display an OUT OF STOCK state on the PDP when stock for a variant is fully depleted. The Add to Bag button will be disabled and a back-in-stock notification option will be presented to the customer. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-028> |\n| CAI-029 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | The system will support a back-in-stock notification: a customer on a OUT OF STOCK PDP can submit their email to be notified when the variant returns to stock  The notify me email ID with product detailes will be submitted to Emarsys. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Notify Emails will come from SFCC, not Emarsy’s.  Confirmed @Emma Kirwan | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3DCAI-034> |\n| CAI-030 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | The system will display a low-stock indicator (without specifying unit quantity) on the PDP at size level when inventory falls below a configurable threshold. Low-stock messaging will not be displayed in the mini-cart or cart page. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-030> |\n| CAI-031 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | The system will allow out-of-stock products to be hidden or suppressed from the PLP, configurable by a business user in SFCC Business Manager. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-031> |\n| CAI-032 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | The system will not implement soft inventory reservation at add-to-cart. Stock will be hard-reserved only when an order is successfully placed. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-032> |\n| CAI-033 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | The system will not indicate split-shipment scenarios to the customer at cart level. Customers will be informed of split shipments post-purchase via Narvar | Zimmerman | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-033> |\n| CAI-034 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | The system will perform a real-time inventory availability check against NewStore OMS (via Mulesoft) when a customer proceeds from cart to checkout entry | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Open Discussion: real-time check for all or only BOPIS/same-day.  Once delivery mode is selected in checkout - not in cart? @Jasmijn Tsang | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3DCAI-034> |\n| CAI-035 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | The system will disable the Checkout CTA and display an error identifying the out-of-stock item(s) if any cart line item is out of stock at checkout entry. The customer must remove out-of-stock items before proceeding. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-035> |\n| CAI-036 | Cart & Inventory | Inventory | The system will notify the customer within the cart when an item in their bag has become out of stock since it was added. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-036> |\n| CAI-037 | Cart & Inventory | Find in Boutique | The system will display a Find in Boutique button on the PDP for eligible products. On interaction, the system will open a modal or flyout panel showing size-specific boutique stock availability. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-037> |\n| CAI-038 | Cart & Inventory | Find in Boutique | The system will perform a real-time call to NewStore OMS via MuleSoft when the customer opens the Find in Boutique modal (once a size has been selected). No automatic refresh will occur while the modal remains open. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Open Discussion: in PDP - not in cart?  Inventory call is made per size but if new size selected or location searched - does it check again - Yes, Mani confirmed, refresh the search if size or location is switched. | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3D%20CAI-038> |\n| CAI-039 | Cart & Inventory | Find in Boutique | The system will display per-boutique availability for the selected size in the Find in Boutique modal: In Stock / Low Stock – Contact Boutique to Confirm Availability / Out of Stock. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-039> |\n| CAI-040 | Cart & Inventory | Find in Boutique | The system will not apply a buffer threshold to boutique stock in the Find in Boutique modal. True physical stock levels from NewStore OMS will be displayed. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-040> |\n| CAI-041 | Cart & Inventory | Find in Boutique | The system will display a clear message in the Find in Boutique modal when no boutiques have the selected size in stock. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | @Jasmijn Tsang comment in requirement document: We need to consider the users location and we could potentially serve inventory from a nearby boutique  Might need more clarity from Zimm on what they want here | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-041> |\n| CAI-042 | Cart & Inventory | Find in Boutique | The system will cache boutique stock availability responses from NewStore OMS, with a configurable TTL, to minimise repeated OMS calls for the same data within the TTL window. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-042> |\n| CAI-043 | Cart & Inventory | Collect in Boutique | The system will perform a real-time call to NewStore OMS via MuleSoft when the customer selects the Collect in Boutique option, validating both store eligibility and stock availability for the selected item and size. | Accenture | UK (domestic), AU (domestic), EU (domestic), UK (domestic) | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-043> |\n| CAI-044 | Cart & Inventory | Collect in Boutique | The system will submit the order to NewStore OMS on placement, designating the selected boutique as the fulfilment location. NewStore OMS will route and assign the order to boutique staff for fulfilment. | Accenture | UK (domestic), AU (domestic), EU (domestic), UK (domestic) | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-044> |\n| CAI-045 | Cart & Inventory | Collect in Boutique | The system will cache Collect in Boutique availability responses from NewStore OMS. The cache is populated on the initial OMS call and refreshed on TTL expiry. Cache TTL is configurable in SFCC Business Manager. | Accenture | UK (domestic), AU (domestic), EU (domestic), UK (domestic) | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-045> |\n| CAI-046 | Cart & Inventory | Exclusive Access | The system will surface and make available exclusive/restricted items to customers in the eligible VIP customer group, based on customer group membership managed via Omneo and configured in SFCC Business Manager.' | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-046> |\n| CAI-047 | Cart & Inventory | Exclusive Access | The system will restrict visibility of exclusive/restricted items to eligible VIP customers only. These items will not be surfaced in search results or on the PLP for customers outside the eligible customer group. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20CAI-047> |\n\n/"
